   "definition_of_done": [
    "Truth table verified for all 16 input combinations: y=1 for inputs (a,b,c,d) representing decimal 0,2,7,8,9,14 (i.e., 0000, 0010, 0111, 1000, 1001, 1110); y=0 for all other 10 combinations.",
    "Every gate has a unique name; no duplicate instance names or signal aliases.",
    "Every gate has a valid type (NAND or NOT), exactly 1 or 2 inputs, and exactly 1 output.",
    "NOT gates are implemented as NAND gates with both inputs tied together, counted as 1 NAND gate toward the 16-gate budget.",
    "Total NAND gate count (including NOT-configured) does not exceed 16.",
    "All output signals are connected to exactly one gate output or primary output; no floating, unconnected, or dangling outputs.",
    "Primary inputs a,b,c,d are correctly mapped (a is MSB with weight 8) and are not driven by any gate output.",
    "Primary output y is the sole output of the design and correctly reflects the specified code detection for all input states."
